      "writtenOn": "2023-05-15T13:20:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t have any concrete suggestion, but the raw handling is a little funny. As I read the CL, I hit the initialization of the decoder list, and thought that if someone registered another decoder after raw, we wouldn\u0027t honor the idea of doing it last. Then I hit this code, and realized that if someone does register a custom raw decoder, we will reorder it relative to any others they\u0027ve registered. I don\u0027t think there\u0027s necessarily anything to solve, just an observation.",
